                                "sense_id": "de959789-1aff-320a-bc76-39c783b5be07",
                                "text": "Fancy her white hands getting redder every day, and her tongue losing its pretty up-country curl in talking, and her bounding walk becoming the regular Hintock shail and wamble!"
